      <li><a href="https://docs.github.com/en/actions/creating-actions/publishing-actions-in-github-marketplace">https://docs.github.com/en/actions/creating-actions/publishing-actions-in-github-marketplace</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://opensource.guide/">https://opensource.guide/</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://github.com/open-source">https://github.com/open-source</a></li>
    </ul>
  HTML
